  Role: pure-Go FFI for loading libcortext without cgo in the binding.

Native runtime (not vendored in this repo)
------------------------------------------

When built with `cortext_native`, the plugin loads `libcortext` and related
assets via cortext.go. Those binaries and their third-party notices ship with
the [augmem/cortext](https://github.com/augmem/cortext) release asset tarball
(`cortext-assets-<version>.tar.gz`). Record asset version and sha256 per
PROVENANCE.md when bundling offline installs.

Stub engine
-----------

Default (non-tagged) builds link an in-process keyword-overlap stub for unit
tests and CI only. The stub is not Cortext retrieval quality; production
installs must use `make build-native` / `make install-native`.
